 "meter": {"about": "the special meter (TODO #71, fighter.c 'special meter'): players only, full at the start and at a new life; a point back every refill frames; a C special costs special, a fury (D, down+D the MAX fury) fury and needs fury_min; a special out of a hit costs hit_mul times as much and the fighter flashes white flash frames; infinite 1 (Bruno 2026-10-06, for the time being): nothing is spent and the gauge stays full (the costs stay in place for when it goes back to 0)", "max": 120, "special": 30, "fury": 60, "fury_min": 60, "refill": 10, "hit_mul": 2, "flash": 8, "infinite": 1},
 "super_flash": {"about": "fx.super_flash (TODO #139, Bruno 2026-10-06: an engine rule, no per-move data but an optional anchor): every fury (D) and MAX fury (down+D) of every fighter. From the fury's frame start the game freezes except the attacker for freeze frames (enemies, projectiles, the camera, waves and timers, other players; only the attacker's own boxes hit: Kim's Phoenix hits inside the flash, KOF's furies 39-47 frames in, after it), the stage is hidden and the backdrop is white_colour for white frames, then dark_colour; KOF98's concentration plays at the anchor (the move's own, read from its KOF animation, else this one: px from the feet, KOF orientation, negative x = forward), blue for a fury, orange for a MAX fury. Values: KOF98's (tools/kof96/handlers98.md 'Super flash': the flash effect's animation + 1 = 28 frames, its white event step + 1 = 4). sound (Bruno 2026-10-06, the fury charge): the effect played at the flash start, KOF98's own: the flash routine $370F0 / $373FC sends sound index $99 = $1A $3A for every DM and SDM alike (measured in our emulator: Terry, Ryo, Ralf, Kyo, DM and MAX, the same command on the flash frame); must be in songs.json sfx. sound_max (TODO #155, Bruno 2026-10-06: KOF2000's MAX sound, the high whistle): played instead of sound when the fury is the MAX (down+D): KOF2000's SDM flash effect, $1E $8F there (measured in our emulator: K' and Terry, every DM flash $1E $BC, every SDM flash $1E $8F), the brawler $1A $8F (songs.json sfx from)", "start": 1, "freeze": 28, "white": 4, "anchor": [0, -96], "white_colour": "0x7FFF", "dark_colour": "0x0000", "sound": "3A", "sound_max": "8F"},
